> Shh... Keep this between us, will you?
> — Denia
 She is a student from [[Startorch Academy]]'s Department of Voidmatters with a sardonic nihilism, who secretly serves as an agent for the [[Fractsidus]]. Despite being created by [[Schwarzloch]] for the purpose of becoming the Resonator of the [[Threnodian]] [[Aleph-1]], she harbors deep-seated fear and resentment towards the Fractsidus and her creator. No matter the price, even her own existence, she is determined to use her "gift" to protect those dearest to her.

==Trivia==
===Etymology===
* ''Do svidánija'' {{Lang|ru=до свида́ния|lit=goodbye/farewell}} is the common way to say goodbye in Russia. The connection is more obvious in Asian languages where her name is ''Daniya''.